# Frontend Next.js

- TypeScript strict; App Router.
- Use TanStack Query for server state and job polling.
- Keep UI minimal and functional for V1 (dashboard, project, job stages).
- Call the FastAPI backend via a small API client; do not embed pipeline logic in the browser.
- Prefer existing shadcn/Tailwind patterns once scaffolded; avoid new UI libraries.
